<view class="page"><view class="hero compact"><view class="eyebrow">ASK FRIENDS</view><view class="hero-title">这次听谁的？</view><view class="hero-copy">审批创建后，商品快照、规则和参与者都不会改变。</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在准备审批…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{!loading}}"><view class="section-title"><text>1. 选择商品</text><text class="section-subtitle">我的购物车</text></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">购物车没有可审批的商品</view><view class="horizontal"><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="mini-product {{itemId === item.id ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseItem"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="price">{{item.priceText}}</view><view class="muted small">{{item.reason}}</view></view></view><view class="section-title"><text>2. 选择好友</text><text class="section-subtitle">{{selectedIds.length}} / 10</text></view><view wx:if="{{!friends.length}}" class="empty">还没有好友，请先互相添加</view><view class="card reviewer-list"><view wx:for="{{friends}}" wx:key="id" class="choice" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="toggleReviewer"><view class="dot {{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}"></view><view class="avatar mini" style="background:{{item.color}}">{{item.initial}}</view><view><view class="title">{{item.name}}</view><view class="muted small">编号 {{item.code}}</view></view></view></view><view class="section-title"><text>3. 决定规则</text></view><view class="card rules"><view class="choice" data-rule="veto" bindtap="chooseRule"><view class="dot {{rule === 'veto' ? 'selected' : ''}}"></view><view><view class="title">一票否决</view><view class="muted small">任一拒绝即不通过；全部接受才通过</view></view></view><view class="choice" data-rule="majority" bindtap="chooseRule"><view class="dot {{rule === 'majority' ? 'selected' : ''}}"></view><view><view class="title">多数决定</view><view class="muted small">超过半数接受即通过；平票拒绝</view></view></view><view class="choice" data-rule="unanimous" bindtap="chooseRule"><view class="dot {{rule === 'unanimous' ? 'selected' : ''}}"></view><view><view class="title">全员一致</view><view class="muted small">等所有人提交，必须全部接受</view></view></view></view><button class="btn-coral btn-wide" loading="{{submitting}}" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">发出审批邀请</button></block></view>
